{"version":1,"content":"<p>為期10日的《第39屆東京國際電影節》，今日(4日)閉幕並舉行頒獎禮。</p><p>日本男星成田凌憑電影《男友們》首封東京電影節影帝，導演三島有紀子代沒有出席的成田領獎。</p><p>內地女星胡伶憑《略知她一二》封后，她眼濕濕領獎，並感謝導演、電影團隊及其父母。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:25:40.748819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.123198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.123198+00:00","content_hash":"a61343c849ea6bff3c9af04aee0c69ecbc5eadb5366cd60108eb596b8cccbb73","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}